WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:08.090
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:35.150
An unexpected envoy of Dark Cooking Society

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:36.820
showed up at the front door

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:41.190
who used to be a young talent

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:43.680
of Yang Spring Restaurant, Lei En.

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:48.520
He and I are going to fight for

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:49.760
the legendary cookware

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:52.150
in Chef Ruoh’s custody.

00:01:54.110 --> 00:01:54.800
Listen up,

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:56.530
Lei En and Mao,

00:01:56.970 --> 00:01:58.350
you’ll have a Knife Skills Competition

00:01:58.530 --> 00:02:00.440
at Daxian Temple

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:03.100
in two days.

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:13.740
Sharpness of Evil Demonic Seven-Star Knives

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:25.520
Mao, are you there?

00:02:27.110 --> 00:02:28.450
Mao, I’m coming in.

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:32.970
Not here either.

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:37.180
Any luck, sister?

00:02:38.150 --> 00:02:39.500
He’s not in his room.

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:42.370
Where could he be at this hour?

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:45.470
The competition is tomorrow.

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:48.640
His rival is strong

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:50.750
and the legendary cookware is at stake.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:52.960
The pressure is on.

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:54.090
He needs some space

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:55.390
to adjust himself.

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:57.080
If so…

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:58.400
There’s only one place.

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:12.910
Mao!

00:03:15.970 --> 00:03:16.660
Mao.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:19.280
What are you guys doing here?

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:20.500
Nothing.

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:21.610
It’s just that

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:23.530
tomorrow is the big day.

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:26.160
We’re wondering what you’re doing.

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:27.470
Mao,

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:29.180
you’ll win, right?

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:30.990
I’m not sure

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:32.000
until I have a go.

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:33.720
But I won’t

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:36.480
let Dark Cooking Society win!

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:37.630
That’s the spirit!

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:39.490
I have faith in you!

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:40.220
Mao,

00:03:40.810 --> 00:03:42.050
what are those thugs up to

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:43.220
anyway?

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:43.970
Well,

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.430
they’re scheming

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:49.530
to control everyone through cooking.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.610
Is that even possible?

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:54.270
All of us, commoners or emperors,

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.360
can’t leave without food,

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:57.080
so those cooking it, namely chefs,

00:03:57.510 --> 00:04:01.220
can determine everyone’s life and death.

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:03.030
Dark Cooking Society

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:05.210
is exploiting that

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.060
to be the ruler underground.

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:11.540
They’ve been training chefs

00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:13.430
in the unthinkable way

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:14.810
to pass down

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:15.860
their evil skills

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:17.060
over the centuries.

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:19.500
Unfortunately...

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:21.320
Somebody help!

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.130
I can’t take this anymore!

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:29.350
Only a few mastered them.

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:30.920
They show no mercy

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:32.180
to those who failed or tried to escape.

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:34.780
Many of them

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.550
ended up dead.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:40.830
How come

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.230
you know so well

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:42.970
about Dark Cooking Society?

00:04:43.770 --> 00:04:44.820
Well, I...

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:46.720
Answer his question.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:48.550
Meili...

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:51.830
It’s been bugging me for a while.

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:54.060
Are you

00:04:57.320 --> 00:04:58.470
also one of them

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:00.580
like Lei En?

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.500
Also, you recognized his skill

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:07.270
when he butchered that buffalo.

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:10.590
That’s right. I found that odd, too.

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:12.250
I remember you said...

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:19.120
I’ve finally seen it for real.

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:21.890
Roaring Bull Green Dragon Chop.

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:26.020
(Roaring Bull Green Dragon Chop)

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:27.910
How do you know

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:29.120
a skill

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:31.050
unique to the dark side?

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:33.750
Mao...

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:41.940
Meili, I’m sorry

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:43.980
for worrying you so much.

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:45.540
Mao...

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:47.100
I meant to

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:49.050
tell you about this long ago.

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:51.500
Mao...

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:55.820
Take a look at this.

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:57.850
What is it?

00:05:57.850 --> 00:05:58.820
It’s

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:01.440
my mother’s old notebook.

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:02.490
Chef Pai’s notebook?

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:04.370
Did you always bring it with you, Mao?

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:06.480
No, I only found it recently.

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:07.790
Recently?

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:12.200
I came across it in Mang, Yunnan Province

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:14.070
when we traveled to the southwest for training.

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:15.630
Mang?

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:17.450
Did we go there?

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:19.420
Do you remember

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:20.300
I got separated from you

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:21.860
for almost three days?

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:24.120
When you broke into

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:26.120
the haunted house and ate red congee?

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:28.720
You mean you found it then?

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:31.760
I went to my mother’s hometown,

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.230
Mang,

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.010
and

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:37.340
dug this notebook out

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:38.930
from

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:40.060
her long-abandoned house.

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:43.730
Is this notebook...?

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:48.660
Mao,

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:49.970
what’s in it?

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:52.000
Recipes,

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:52.920
of course.

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:54.510
Then

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:55.930
they're nothing special.

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:57.990
They aren’t any recipes,

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:00.040
but they introduce

00:07:00.090 --> 00:07:01.580
a new side

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:04.340
of my mother to me.

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:05.580
What do you mean?

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:07.180
This notebook

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:09.630
records every battle

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:12.800
between her

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:14.790
and chefs of Dark Cooking Society.

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:19.970
Battles between Chef Pai and Dark Cooking Society?

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:20.900
I see.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.130
So she wrote down

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:25.290
their recipes, too.

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:28.200
That’s why you’re familiar with their skills.

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:28.870
Yes.

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:31.490
That explains everything.

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:34.440
I’m sorry that I doubted you.

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:38.480
Also, she kept note of

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:40.870
others’ misfortune brought by that Society

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:43.020
out of anger and compassion.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.690
I didn’t mean to tell everyone about this notebook

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:49.820
until I knew better of those people,

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:53.420
but soon after my return to Guangzhou,

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:54.470
I've been challenged by Li Yan

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:56.080
and Lei En.

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:58.220
Right now, my blood is boiling!

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:00.510
It’s time to follow in my mother’s footsteps.

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:04.600
She always

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.010
wished people happiness

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:08.480
and Zhou Yu has taught me

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:09.980
how to bring people happiness with food.

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:12.580
I don’t know

00:08:12.710 --> 00:08:14.500
how much I can do,

00:08:15.150 --> 00:08:17.760
but I’ll battle as a Super Chef

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:20.430
and foil

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:22.490
Dark Cooking Society’s plot

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:26.320
with this knife embedded with my mother’s soul!

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:34.230
The Knife Skills Competition

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:35.860
is about to begin.

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:38.190
I heard it’s a battle within Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:51.030
The legendary cookware is right inside!

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:54.180
Ever since the last owner passed away

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:55.680
400 years ago,

00:08:55.730 --> 00:08:57.070
tons of chefs

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:58.870
have tried to gain ownership of it

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:00.620
but failed eventually.

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:04.840
So far, no one has proven their worthiness.

00:09:06.030 --> 00:09:08.220
Is it that tough?

00:09:14.390 --> 00:09:16.270
The Knife Skills Competition

00:09:16.310 --> 00:09:17.980
at Daxian Temple to select the new owner

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:21.480
of the Legendary Cookware will soon begin.

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:23.640
Look who’s here!

00:09:23.690 --> 00:09:25.010
It’s that old fogy.

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:26.420
What’s wrong with him?

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:27.360
Why look so serious?

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:31.740
You’ll be dealing with pagrus major.

00:09:36.120 --> 00:09:37.640
Look at them! They're big!

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:39.220
All parts of that fish

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:40.680
is edible,

00:09:40.920 --> 00:09:42.590
so you must be extremely careful

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:44.690
not to break anything.

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:46.550
In a word,

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:48.020
your knife skills

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:50.370
will directly affect its taste.

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:54.010
First up, Lei En of Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:54.830
Please step forward.

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:56.930
Wow!

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:59.760
That’s seven knives in total. He’s fully equipped!

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:01.800
He’s well-prepared for the duel.

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:03.070
Clearly, he’s here to win.

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:04.510
The other chef

00:10:04.560 --> 00:10:05.740
must look like a rack of tools, too.

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:06.890
Can’t wait to see him.

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:09.350
Next,

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:10.240
Mao of the same restaurant.

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:11.060
Please step forward.

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:12.380
Yes.

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:16.640
Mao!

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:22.110
What’s the matter with you, Mao?

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:23.070
You show up

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:25.120
at the Knife Skills Competition with no knives!

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:28.100
Your opponent has seven of them!

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:31.780
Where’s your mother’s knife?

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:32.660
If they’re competing like this,

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:33.550
the legendary cookware

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:34.940
will definitely go to Lei En,

00:10:35.090 --> 00:10:36.580
that underling of Dark Cooking Society!

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:37.320
Chef Zhou Yu,

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:38.700
why did you propose such a competition?

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.350
It was reckless!

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:41.880
Agreed.

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:43.160
You’re doing

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:44.340
our enemies a favor!

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:45.780
Calm down.

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:48.630
This competition

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:50.290
isn’t only about knife skills.

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:53.970
Care to explain it?

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:56.460
Just wait and see.

00:10:58.150 --> 00:10:59.700
Lei En and Mao,

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:01.810
as per tradition,

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:04.970
there’s no time limit.

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:06.880
All you need to do

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:08.310
is to make four pagrus major dishes

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:09.750
that you think they’ll win.

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:11.990
But here’s something

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:12.850
you should know.

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:16.760
The huge fish in front of you

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:18.320
was caught

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:19.500
today at sunrise.

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:26.850
You may begin!

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:36.270
Goodness!

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:39.860
There it is.

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:41.590
Seven-Star Knives!

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:44.620
My Seven-Star Knives can cut anything instantly.

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:46.820
Seven-Star Cut!

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:51.940
Impressive!

00:11:52.050 --> 00:11:53.380
He’s working two knives

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:54.970
to scale the fish!

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:10.130
Unbelievable!

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:16.780
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:12:29.940 --> 00:12:30.820
He keeps

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:32.210
changing the knives

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:34.400
so fast that I can barely see his moves.

00:12:34.610 --> 00:12:36.090
Seven-Star Cut.

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:37.720
Was that also invented by Dark Cooking Society?

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:39.210
What’s there to see?

00:12:39.810 --> 00:12:42.110
He hasn’t used any of their skills yet.

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:45.460
To scale the fish,

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:47.770
he cleaned the dorsal side

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:50.810
with a curvy knife

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:52.630
and removed smaller scales under the fins

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:55.170
with a small knife.

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:58.800
To get fillets,

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:00.680
he cut the belly open

00:13:00.730 --> 00:13:03.120
with a thick square knife

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:05.990
and he removed the bones

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:08.360
with the help of the knife back.

00:13:09.340 --> 00:13:11.470
He chose the right knife

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:13.100
for each part

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:17.070
and cut it precisely.

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:20.170
His speed and precision

00:13:20.680 --> 00:13:21.910
are way beyond the average, though.

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:25.410
You can’t hesitate when processing this fish.

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:27.630
Hesitation will only slow down your knife.

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:29.840
A sweaty palm and a dragging knife

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:31.270
will ruin the taste.

00:13:32.030 --> 00:13:34.450
But he showed no hesitation

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:35.940
and cut the fish swiftly

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:37.910
without

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:39.050
damaging any tissue.

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:40.980
Lei En is good.

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:47.280
My first dish is done.

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:50.180
Good job!

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:52.140
He’s doing that again.

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:53.400
That he’s too busy watching skills new to him

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:55.050
to cook his own dishes.

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:55.860
He must stop.

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:57.680
Or how could he win?

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:58.880
Relax.

00:13:58.930 --> 00:14:00.200
Don’t worry.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:02.020
Why aren’t you worried, Silang?

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:03.710
Because this time,

00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:06.640
Mao is determined to win.

00:14:07.090 --> 00:14:08.620
Yes. We should

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:10.350
believe in him!

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:15.240
You can do this, Mao!

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:18.490
Mao,

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:20.790
show everyone what you’ve got!

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:26.980
He doesn’t even have a knife.

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:29.210
What’s he going to do?

00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:30.250
Mao...

00:14:34.270 --> 00:14:35.670
He puts his hands on the fish.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.460
What’s that for?

00:14:53.090 --> 00:14:54.550
He’s scaling the fish

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:56.240
with his hands!

00:14:57.900 --> 00:14:58.670
That’s impossible!

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:02.070
Those scales could make knives blunt,

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:03.500
but he’s scraping them off barehanded!

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:10.030
Is that some sort of magic?

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:12.350
Look closely at his hands.

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:19.090
There’s something sparkling.

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:19.810
Is that...?

00:15:21.860 --> 00:15:22.780
A steel wire!

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:26.320
He’s using a steel wire knife to scale the fish.

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:27.850
Steel wire knife?

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:29.260
Amazing!

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:30.840
You’re brilliant, Mao!

00:15:31.050 --> 00:15:33.490
Some secret weapon you’ve got!

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:34.550
I see.

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:35.520
That wire

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:37.470
can reach every corner of the fish.

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:38.500
In that case,

00:15:38.550 --> 00:15:39.480
Lei En’s Seven-Star Knives

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:41.410
won’t be his match.

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:44.270
No, that wire isn’t good enough.

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:45.290
Father.

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:46.390
Why?

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:47.800
Mao is doing great

00:15:47.850 --> 00:15:49.040
with that wire.

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:50.940
That thin wire

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:52.650
can remove the scales

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:54.770
but it’s not strong enough

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:56.950
to cut through the bones or the thick meat.

00:15:58.420 --> 00:16:00.610
He needs more

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:02.390
to rival Lei En.

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:04.140
Really?

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:11.400
He just stopped.

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:13.520
What’s he going to do next?

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:21.760
My second dish is done.

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:26.020
Lei En has finished two dishes already.

00:16:26.070 --> 00:16:26.850
He’s way ahead of Mao!

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:28.570
Wake up, Mao!

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:29.880
Do something

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:32.350
before the fish becomes less fresh!

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:33.820
Shorty,

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:35.230
how long are you going to stand there?

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:36.720
Are you quitting?

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:37.580
Yes!

00:16:37.630 --> 00:16:40.000
Your fish is going bad!

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:42.720
What’s wrong, Mao?

00:16:47.780 --> 00:16:48.770
Is he going to be late?

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:52.410
No, he’ll make it.

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:54.140
What’s happening,

00:16:54.190 --> 00:16:55.160
Mao?

00:16:55.260 --> 00:16:55.830
Mao!

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:00.370
Mao!

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:02.780
Hey, Mao!

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:07.780
Excuse me. Make a way!

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:08.870
Coming through!

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:11.320
What now?

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:11.980
Mao!

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:14.900
Finally, Chef Xie!

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:16.850
Sorry, I’m late.

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:18.270
Chef Xie!

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:20.310
What’s he doing here?

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:21.730
It’s done

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:23.860
as you asked.

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:25.220
Here you are.

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:39.580
A real knife, finally!

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:41.540
It’s too late.

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:42.460
One knife stands no chance

00:17:42.510 --> 00:17:44.440
against seven.

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:45.860
I guess you're right.

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:49.270
Isn’t that his mother’s knife?

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:50.420
That’s it?

00:17:50.610 --> 00:17:52.570
I was expecting

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:54.870
something way more powerful.

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:01.250
What’s that?

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:06.370
What the hell?

00:18:06.420 --> 00:18:07.940
How come it bends so easily?

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:10.620
What’s with that knife?

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:12.350
It works. It really does.

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:13.950
Thanks, Chef Xie!

00:18:14.050 --> 00:18:14.670
Sure.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:19.850
Is that knife...?

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:21.690
Look, mother.

00:18:22.190 --> 00:18:23.490
I’m going to beat

00:18:23.570 --> 00:18:24.850
Dark Cooking Society with this very knife.

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:31.650
It bends with the fish.

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.760
What is that thing?

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:37.670
What’s going on?

00:18:39.980 --> 00:18:41.260
The flexibility of the knife

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:42.690
can help remove the bones.

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:44.990
That’s it! That knife

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:47.260
won’t damage the fish.

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:48.810
Exactly! It’s perfect!

00:18:48.930 --> 00:18:51.090
Mao is the best!

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:52.830
Hi, guys.

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:53.740
Chef Xie!

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:55.640
Did you reshape that knife?

00:18:56.020 --> 00:18:56.950
Yes.

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:58.400
But I did have my doubts

00:18:58.710 --> 00:18:59.950
when he asked me

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:01.180
to make Chef Pai’s knife

00:19:01.230 --> 00:19:02.650
like that.

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:06.640
Luckily, I managed to pull it off.

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:08.580
But look at my hand.

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:10.120
I got those scars overnight.

00:19:15.470 --> 00:19:16.630
I worked hard

00:19:16.680 --> 00:19:17.850
to make that knife right.

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:20.220
However you bend it,

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:21.900
it won't snap.

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.380
Why did he ask for a knife
that can bend in the first place?

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:26.370
Mao,

00:19:26.780 --> 00:19:28.170
show them

00:19:28.170 --> 00:19:29.500
the knife you invented!

00:19:39.310 --> 00:19:40.920
What? Sunlight?

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:42.770
It goes right through it!

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:43.720
Look,

00:19:43.770 --> 00:19:45.640
there are little holes on it.

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:48.050
I see.

00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:51.640
I got it! Those holes

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:52.910
make the knife bend.

00:19:53.240 --> 00:19:54.430
Not just that.

00:19:54.760 --> 00:19:56.390
They allow air to pass through,

00:19:56.490 --> 00:19:58.550
so the meat won’t stick to the knife

00:19:58.870 --> 00:20:00.580
thus increasing the cutting speed.

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:02.160
Meili,

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:04.250
that special knife

00:20:04.540 --> 00:20:06.220
must be Dark Cooking Society's trick

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:08.040
that Chef Pai wrote down in her notebook.

00:20:08.190 --> 00:20:09.490
But is it really necessary

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:11.780
to have

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:13.110
what his mother left him remodeled?

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:14.960
Mao

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:18.110
is eager to win.

00:20:18.340 --> 00:20:19.600
Just watch it.

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:22.180
He won’t let us down!

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:25.400
Don’t let my hard work go to waste!

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:26.320
Mao!

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:28.000
Go get him, Mao!

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:37.400
That can’t be.

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:39.500
That’s exclusive

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:40.670
to Dark Cooking Society.

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:43.320
The Hundred-Hole Knife!

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:46.990
How did an outsider

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:49.000
learn about that knife?

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:56.910
He’s more than he shows.

00:20:57.390 --> 00:20:59.250
I must give it my all.

00:21:12.260 --> 00:21:13.460
At this stage,

00:21:13.510 --> 00:21:16.010
both of them have the perfect knives for the fish,

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:17.500
so they're tied on the tools.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:18.700
Next,

00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:20.500
the final result

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:21.600
depends on how much faith

00:21:21.770 --> 00:21:22.950
they cook with.

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:27.550
Kid,

00:21:28.210 --> 00:21:29.470
the legendary cookware

00:21:29.650 --> 00:21:31.140
will belong to me,

00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:32.990
Lei En, the best of Dark Cooking Society!

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:38.120
I won’t lose

00:21:38.120 --> 00:21:39.450
to those

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:40.900
who bring misfortune to others.

00:23:14.976 --> 00:23:17.020
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.930 --> 00:23:19.312
Lei En's cooking is awesome.

00:23:19.583 --> 00:23:23.082
The overwhelming skill left the judges
completely euphoric.

00:23:23.218 --> 00:23:24.784
Silang, could you give me a hand?

00:23:24.784 --> 00:23:26.617
now it's my turn to cook.

00:23:27.262 --> 00:23:28.685
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:28.950 --> 00:23:30.657
Four Chinese Regions Locked!

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:32.358
Red Sea Bream Continental Seal

00:23:32.523 --> 00:23:33.796
It will definitely be interesting!
